## 3. COMO INSTANCIAR O SQUAD

Ao ativar esta skill, execute os passos na ordem:

### PASSO 1 — Coletar Contexto da Agência

Pergunte ao usuário (se não já informado):
1. **Domínio:** Qual o tipo de projeto/produto que a agência vai construir?
2. **Stack preferida:** Frontend, Backend, Database, Auth?
3. **Integrações externas:** APIs de terceiros já definidas?
4. **Restrições de negócio:** Prazos, orçamento de tokens, time de pessoas?
5. **Nível de especialização:** Base, Fase 1, Fase 2 ou Fase 3?

### PASSO 2 — Gerar o `agency-config.json`

Crie o arquivo de configuração central do squad:

```json
{
  "agency_id": "<UUID>",
  "project_name": "<nome>",
  "stack": {
    "frontend": "<ex: Next.js>",
    "backend": "<ex: Node.js>",
    "database": "<ex: Supabase>",
    "auth": "<ex: Supabase Auth>"
  },
  "harness": {
    "cost_model": {"flash": 0.60, "sonnet": 0.30, "opus": 0.10},
    "max_correction_rounds": 3,
    "context_hygiene": {"compact_at": "60%", "clear_after_compactions": 3},
    "test_coverage_minimum": 0.80,
    "lighthouse_target": 90
  },
  "phases": {
    "phase1": {
      "enabled": true,
      "agents": ["db_agent", "backend_agent", "frontend_agent", "integration_agent"]
    },
    "phase2": {
      "enabled": true,
      "agents": ["test_agent", "devops_agent"]
    },
    "phase3": {
      "enabled": false,
      "agents": ["performance_agent", "ux_accessibility_agent", "documentation_agent"]
    }
  },
  "agents": [
    {"id": "orchestrator", "model": "opus", "active": true},
    {"id": "discovery", "model": "sonnet", "active": true},
    {"id": "prd_generator", "model": "sonnet", "active": true},
    {"id": "prd_validator", "model": "flash", "active": true},
    {"id": "tech_architect", "model": "sonnet", "active": true},
    {"id": "spec_generator", "model": "sonnet", "active": true},
    {"id": "spec_enricher", "model": "sonnet", "active": true},
    {"id": "sprint_planner", "model": "flash", "active": true},
    {"id": "db_agent", "model": "sonnet", "active": true},
    {"id": "backend_agent", "model": "sonnet", "active": true},
    {"id": "frontend_agent", "model": "sonnet", "active": true},
    {"id": "integration_agent", "model": "sonnet", "active": true},
    {"id": "test_agent", "model": "sonnet", "active": true},
    {"id": "devops_agent", "model": "sonnet", "active": true},
    {"id": "performance_agent", "model": "sonnet", "active": false},
